      47.85,
      370.33,
      539.89,
      394.36
    ],
    "text": "REGULATIONS made by the Minister of Health, Nutrition and Indigenous Medicine under Section 30 read with Section 33of the National Authority on Tobacco and Alcohol Act, No. 27 of 2006.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      409.33,
      538.9,
      485.32
    ],
    "text": "RAJITHA SENARATHNE,Minister of Health, Nutrition andIndigenous Medicine.Colombo,31st August 2016.Regulations",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      500.29,
      502.64,
      511.36
    ],
    "text": "1. These Regulations may be cited as the regulations on Prohibited Tobacco Products No. ...... of 2016.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      518.29,
      530.28,
      529.36
    ],
    "text": "2. The categories of tobacco products which do not generate smoke shall be as specified in Schedule I hereto.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      536.29,
      539.86,
      547.36
    ],
    "text": "3. No person shall manufacture, import, sell or offer for sale any tobacco product specified in Schedule I and II hereto.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      554.29,
      181.66,
      565.36
    ],
    "text": "4. In these regulations \u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
